#
# The same refusal as a `when` condition: the condition site's wrapper is counted first, so the console
# summary shows the key's definition and the bracket spellings and cuts before the definition of `X`; the
# member spellings are read from the JSON report.
#
rule r when Resources.A.Properties.Rules[*][ R1 exists ] !empty { Resources.A.Type == 'X' }
